=\"text-align:center;background-color:#f0f1f2;\">Statistik</th></tr><tr><th style=\"text-align:left; width:35%; text-align:left; vertical-align:top;\">Spelade&#160;matcher</th><td class=\"\" style=\"\">81</td></tr><tr><th style=\"text-align:left; width:35%; text-align:left; vertical-align:top;\">Totalt&#160;antal&#160;mål</th><td class=\"\" style=\"\">255 (3,1 per match)</td></tr><tr><th style=\"text-align:left; width:35%; text-align:left; vertical-align:top;\">Största&#160;hemmavinst</th><td class=\"\" style=\"\"><a href=\"/wiki/Hammarby_IF_Fotboll\" title=\"Hammarby IF Fotboll\">Hammarby</a> 8–1 <a href=\"/wiki/%C3%96rgryte_IS\" title=\"Örgryte IS\">Örgryte</a><br /><span style=\"font-size:smaller; line-height:130%\">(18 april 2026)</span></td></tr><tr><th style=\"text-align:left; width:35%; text-align:left; vertical-align:top;\">Största&#160;bortavinst</th><td class=\"\" style=\"\"><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" style=\"border:none;text-align:center;\"><div style=\"font-weight:bold;background-color:transparent;color:inherit;text-align:center;\">4 matcher</div>\n<div class=\"mw-collapsible-content\" style=\"font-weight:normal;background-color:transparent;color:inherit;text-align:left;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Degerfors_IF\" title=\"Degerfors IF\">Degerfors</a> 0–3 <a href=\"/wiki/IK_Sirius_FK\" title=\"IK Sirius FK\">Sirius</a><br /><span style=\"font-size:smaller; line-height:130%\">(4 april 2026)</span><br /><a href=\"/wiki/Halmstads_BK\" title=\"Halmstads BK\">Halmstad</a> 0–3 <a href=\"/wiki/Degerfors_IF\" title=\"Degerfors IF\">Degerfors</a><br /><span style=\"font-size:smaller; line-height:130%\">(12 april 2026)</span><br /><a href=\"/wiki/AIK_Fotboll\" title=\"AIK Fotboll\">AIK</a> 0–3 <a href=\"/wiki/IK_Sirius_FK\" title=\"IK Sirius FK\">Sirius</a><br /><span style=\"font-size:smaller; line-height:130%\">(30 maj 2026)</span><br /><a href=\"/wiki/Degerfors_IF\" title=\"Degerfors IF\">Degerfors</a> 1–4 <a href=\"/wiki/Mj%C3%A4llby_AIF\" title=\"Mjällby AIF\">Mjällby</a><br /><span style=\"font-size:smaller; line-height:130%\">(9 maj 2026)</span></div></div></td></tr><tr><th style=\"text-align:left; width:35%; text-align:left; vertical-align:top;\">Målrikaste match</th><td class=\"\" style=\"\"><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" style=\"border:none;text-align:center;\"><div style=\"font-weight:bold;background-color:transparent;color:inherit;text-align:center;\">2 matcher</div>\n<div class=\"mw-collapsible-content\" style=\"font-weight:normal;background-color:transparent;color:inherit;text-align:left;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Hammarby_IF_Fotboll\" title=\"Hammarby IF Fotboll\">Hammarby</a> 8–1 <a href=\"/wiki/%C3%96rgryte_IS\" title=\"Örgryte IS\">Örgryte</a><br /><span style=\"font-size:smaller; line-height:130%\">(18 april 2026)</span><br /><a href=\"/wiki/V%C3%A4ster%C3%A5s_SK_FK\" title=\"Västerås SK FK\">Västerås</a> 4–5 <a href=\"/wiki/IFK_G%C3%B6teborg\" title=\"IFK Göteborg\">Göteborg</a><br /><span style=\"font-size:smaller; line-height:130%\">(31 maj 2026)</span></div></div></td></tr><tr><th style=\"text-align:left; width:35%; text-align:left; vertical-align:top;\">Högsta&#160;åskådarantal</th><td class=\"\" style=\"\">46&#160;278. <a href=\"/wiki/AIK_Fotboll\" title=\"AIK Fotboll\">AIK</a> 2–4 <a href=\"/wiki/Djurg%C3%A5rdens_IF_Fotboll\" title=\"Djurgårdens IF Fotboll\">Djurgården</a><br /><span style=\"font-size:smaller; line-height:130%\">(10 maj 2026)</span></td></tr><tr><th style=\"text-align:left; width:35%; text-align:left; vertical-align:top;\">Lägsta&#160;åskådarantal</th><td class=\"\" style=\"\">817. <a href=\"/wiki/IF_Brommapojkarna\" title=\"IF Brommapojkarna\">Brommapojkarna</a> 1–0 <a href=\"/wiki/Kalmar_FF\" title=\"Kalmar FF\">Kalmar</a><br /><span style=\"font-size:smaller; line-height:130%\">(17 maj 2026)</span></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align:center;\" class=\"\"><div style=\"float: left;\">&#8592; <a href=\"/wiki/Fotbollsallsvenskan_2025\" title=\"Fotbollsallsvenskan 2025\">2025</a> </div><div style=\"float: right;\"><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=Fotbollsallsvenskan_2027&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Fotbollsallsvenskan 2027 [inte skriven än]\">2027</a> &#8594;</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div><small>All statistik korrekt per den 31 maj 2026.</small></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><b>Fotbollsallsvenskan 2026</b> är den 102:a säsongen av <a href=\"/wiki/Allsvenskan_(fotboll)\" title=\"Allsvenskan (fotboll)\">Allsvenskan</a> sedan starten 1924 och är Sveriges högsta division i <a href=\"/wiki/Fotboll\" title=\"Fotboll\">fotboll</a> 2026.\n</p>\n<meta property=\"mw:PageProp/toc\" />\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading2\"><h2 id=\"Lag_och_arenor\">Lag och arenor</h2><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=Fotbollsallsvenskan_2026&amp;veaction=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Redigera avsnitt: Lag och arenor\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\"><span>redigera</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-divider\"> | </span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=Fotbollsallsvenskan_2026&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Redigera avsnitts källkod: Lag och arenor\"><span>redigera wikitext</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"thumb tright\"><div class=\"thumbinner\" style=\"position: relative; top: 0px; right: 0px; width: 250px;\"><div class=\"thumbinner noresize\" style=\"position: relative; outline:0px; border:0px; padding:0px;top: 0px; right: 0px; height: 300px; width: 250px\"><a class=\"mw-kartographer-map notheme noviewer mw-file-description mw-kartographer-container floatright\" style=\"min-width: 250px; min-height: 300px;\" data-mw-kartographer=\"mapframe\" data-style=\"osm\" data-width=\"250\" data-height=\"300\" data-zoom=\"5\" data-lat=\"58\" data-lon=\"14\" href=\"/wiki/Special:Map/5/58/14/sv\"><img class=\"mw-file-element\" src=\"https://maps.wikimedia.org/img/osm,5,58,14,250x300.png?lang=sv